{"articleNo":"106707","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=106707&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"학내 일부 종교단체 불법 포교활동 주의 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.05.21","hit":"3130","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학내 일부 종교단체 불법포교활동 주의 알림</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">최근 학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">특히 여학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">들을 주요 대상으로 하여 일부 종교단체의 불법적인 포교 활동 행위가 빈번히 발생하고 있어</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">자칫 학생들의 정신적</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">경제적 피해가 우려되고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다양한 감언이설 등으로 접근하여 개인발전으로 중요한 시기를 틈타 학생 여러분들에 심각한 문제를 야기하고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">심지어 학업까지 중단하게 되는 등&nbsp;학생본인 뿐만 아니라 가족 모두에게 지울 수 없는 상처를 남기게 되기도 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학생여러분들은&nbsp;편향된 일부 종교단체의 포교활동 행위에 휘말리지 않도록 각별한 주의와 경계를 당부 드리며, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이와 같은 사례가 학내에서 발견될 시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">즉시 학생처로 연락해 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.(478-7044)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><font color=\"#7c84ef\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">토요일, 공휴일 : 당직실 478-7000,&nbsp; 정문 수위실 478-7101</span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학 생 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
